# Holiday Home Booking Project Rules
- Environment: Static Frontend (GitHub Pages) + Backend (Supabase Edge Function).
- Cost Constraint: $0 (No paid tiers).
- Styling: Tailwind CSS (Modern, clean "Airbnb" aesthetic with coastal theme).
- Calendar: Custom-built multi-month calendar (12 months ahead, horizontal scroll).
- Data Flow: Frontend -> fetch -> Supabase Edge Function (rnr-api) -> PostgREST (schema: rnr).
- Formatting: Use ISO 8601 (YYYY-MM-DD) for all date handling to avoid timezone issues.
- Security: Family/Admin passwords (Edge Function secrets) + optional PIN codes per booking.
- Features: Room booking (3 doubles / single / sofabed / Entire House), conflict detection, activity logging, admin dashboard.
